flowchart TD
  Prompt["UserPromptSubmit event (stdin JSON)"] --> Shim["hook/shim.py main()"]
  Shim -->|"unix socket, 3s timeout, fail open"| DaemonSock["daemon.sock"]
  Shim -->|"daemon unreachable"| Autostart["autostart(): spawn 'hybrid-retrieval serve' detached"]
  Shim -->|"response.ok"| Render["render(paths) -> <retrieved-context> path list only, no file contents"]

  DaemonSock --> Dispatch["daemon/server.py Daemon.dispatch(op)"]
  Dispatch -->|ping| Ping["health/version reply"]
  Dispatch -->|retrieve| Retrieve["_retrieve(): resolve repo, _state(), backfill loop"]
  Dispatch -->|shutdown| Shutdown["_shutdown_soon()"]

  Retrieve --> PipelineRetrieve["retrieve/pipeline.py retrieve()"]

  subgraph Stages["retrieve.pipeline stages (each degrades, never fails)"]
    direction TB
    Skip["skip.should_skip(prompt) -- gate out noise prompts"]
    Gen["generate_candidates(): sparse + dense -> rrf_fuse"]
    Sparse["sparse.sparse_candidates: BM25 + AST-expand"]
    Dense["dense.dense_candidates: vector search (needs embedder + dense_ready)"]
    Fuse["fusion.rrf_fuse"]
    Rerank["rerank(): rank.features.extract -> Ranker.rerank (trained model, else fused order stands)"]
    Gate["rank.gate.evaluate -> GateDecision (HIGH/LOW confidence)"]
    Fallback["fallback.ripgrep_candidates (low confidence override)"]
    Assemble["assemble.assemble -> ContextPack (skipped when assemble=False, paths-only)"]
    Skip --> Gen --> Sparse & Dense
    Sparse --> Fuse
    Dense --> Fuse
    Fuse --> Rerank --> Gate
    Gate -->|low confidence| Fallback
    Gate -->|high confidence| Assemble
    Fallback --> Assemble
  end

  PipelineRetrieve --> Stages
  Assemble --> TraceRow["trace.record() -> traces table"]
  TraceRow --> Retrieve
  Retrieve --> Dispatch

  subgraph Index["index build (separate from query path)"]
    Walker["index/walker.py discover()"] --> Indexer["index/indexer.py index_repo()"]
    Indexer --> LangAdapters["lang/*.py adapter_for(lang).chunk/symbols/import_refs"]
    Indexer --> Edges["index/edges.py rebuild_edges (import graph)"]
    Indexer --> Backfill["embed/backfill.py embed_pending() (dense vectors, async loop in daemon)"]
  end

  Index -.->|feeds| Sparse
  Backfill -.->|feeds| Dense

  CLI["cli.py cmd_index / cmd_embed / cmd_train"] --> Index
  CLI --> TrainRanker["train/train.py train_ranker (mines git history + sessions)"]
  TrainRanker -.->|writes model| Rerank
